Enhanced renderer (beta): glow strength, colour looks, sharpening, vignette, a steadier glow on macOS, and smoke that is shaded by the room behind it and fades properly whatever its blend (Vulkan and Metal). Picture only: nothing in the simulation changes. SPIR-V in gfx_vk_shaders.h rebuilt with glslang 15.1 from Shaders/*.glsl (the untouched passes come out bit for bit the same).

